<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>사회 활동지 - 합리적 선택</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jua&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; background-color: #fffbeb; }
        .font-jua { font-family: 'Jua', sans-serif; }
        
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #9ca3af; border-radius: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #6b7280; }

        .clay-input {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 2px solid #d1d5db;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .clay-input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #f59e0b;
            box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.02), 0 0 0 3px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
        }
        textarea.clay-input { resize: none; line-height: 1.8; }

        .inline-blank {
            width: 70px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 3px dashed #f59e0b;
            background-color: transparent;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #b45309;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .inline-blank:focus { outline: none; border-bottom-color: #d97706; background-color: #fef3c7; }
        .inline-blank.correct { border-bottom: 3px solid #3b82f6; background-color: #eff6ff; color: #1d4ed8; }
        .inline-blank.wrong { border-bottom: 3px solid #ef4444; background-color: #fef2f2; color: #b91c1c; }
        .inline-blank::placeholder { color: #9ca3af; font-weight: normal; }
        
        .ox-blank { width: 40px; }

        .food-card { transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out; }
        .food-card.selected { border-color: #f59e0b; background-color: #fef3c7; transform: scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); }

        .loader { border: 4px solid #f3f3f3; border-top: 4px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 50%; width: 40px; height: 40px; animation: spin 1s linear infinite; }
        @keyframes spin { 0% { transform: rotate(0deg); } 100% { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
        .modal-animate { animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-out forwards; }
        @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.9); } to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); } }
        
        .dashed-bg {
            line-height: 64px !important;
            background-image: linear-gradient(transparent 62px, #fde68a 62px, #fde68a 64px);
            background-size: 100% 64px;
            background-attachment: local;
            background-position-y: 24px;
        }
        
        .dashed-bg-sm {
            line-height: 48px !important;
            background-image: linear-gradient(transparent 46px, #fde68a 46px, #fde68a 48px);
            background-size: 100% 48px;
            background-attachment: local;
            background-position-y: 16px;
        }

        .history-row { background-color: #f8fafc; opacity: 0.9; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="p-2 md:p-6 min-h-screen text-gray-800">

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-4 md:p-8 shadow-2xl relative border-8 border-amber-100">
        
        <div id="saveIndicator" class="absolute top-4 right-6 text-sm font-bold text-amber-600 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 z-50">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up"></i> 자동 저장됨
        </div>

        <header class="mb-10 relative z-10 text-center mt-4">
            <div class="mb-2 text-amber-700 font-bold tracking-widest text-sm">사회 3. 경제활동과 지역 간 교류</div>
            <div class="bg-amber-500 text-white inline-block px-8 py-3 rounded-full shadow-md border-4 border-amber-600 mb-6">
                <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-jua tracking-wider">
                    [4차시] 합리적 선택이 필요한 까닭은 무엇일까요?
                </h1>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 bg-amber-50 p-4 rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-200 w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <input type="number" id="grade" class="w-16 text-center border-b-2 border-amber-400 bg-transparent focus:outline-none font-bold text-lg" value="4" readonly oninput="window.saveLocal()">학년
                    <input type="number" id="classNum" class="w-16 text-center border-b-2 border-amber-400 bg-transparent focus:outline-none font-bold text-lg" placeholder="반" oninput="window.saveLocal()">반
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <input type="number" id="studentNum" class="w-16 text-center border-b-2 border-amber-400 bg-transparent focus:outline-none font-bold text-lg" placeholder="번" oninput="window.saveLocal()">번
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <input type="text" id="studentName" class="w-24 text-center border-b-2 border-amber-400 bg-transparent focus:outline-none font-bold text-lg" placeholder="이름" oninput="window.saveLocal()">
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- 1. 경제활동에서의 선택 경험 -->
        <section class="mb-12">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4 border-b-4 border-amber-200 pb-2">
                <div class="bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl font-jua">1</div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-jua text-amber-900">경제활동을 하면서 선택했던 경험을 나누어 봅시다.</h2>
            </div>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <!-- 후회한 경험 -->
                <div class="bg-rose-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-rose-200 flex flex-col h-[350px]">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3">
                        <label class="font-bold text-rose-900 flex items-center gap-2 text-lg"><i class="fa-regular fa-face-frown-open text-2xl text-rose-500"></i> 선택을 후회한 경험</label>
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 w-32 items-end z-10">
                            <div class="flex bg-rose-200 p-1 rounded-lg w-full">
                                <button onclick="window.setMode('exp_regret', 'text')" id="btn_text_exp_regret" class="flex-1 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-white text-rose-600 shadow-sm rounded-md transition-all">⌨️ 자판</button>
                                <button onclick="window.setMode('exp_regret', 'draw')" id="btn_draw_exp_regret" class="flex-1 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-800 rounded-md transition-all">🖊️ 펜</button>
                            </div>
                            <div id="toolbar_exp_regret" class="hidden flex-col gap-1 w-full">
                                <div class="flex bg-amber-100 p-1 rounded-lg w-full border border-amber-200">
                                    <button onclick="window.pads['exp_regret'].setTool('pen')" id="btn_tool_pen_exp_regret" class="flex-1 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-white text-amber-700 shadow-sm rounded-md transition-all" title="쓰기">✏️</button>
                                    <button onclick="window.pads['exp_regret'].setTool('eraser')" id="btn_tool_eraser_exp_regret" class="flex-1 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-800 rounded-md transition-all" title="지우개">🧹</button>
                                </div>
                                <button onclick="window.pads['exp_regret'].clear()" class="w-full text-xs bg-rose-100 text-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-200 py-1 rounded-md font-bold shadow-sm">전체 지우기</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="relative flex-1 w-full h-full -mt-4">
                        <textarea id="exp_regret" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full clay-input p-4 text-lg font-medium resize-none dashed-bg-sm outline-none focus:bg-rose-100 transition-colors" placeholder="(예) 할인 매장에서 과자를 샀는데 생각보다 양이 적어서 속상했던 적이 있습니다." oninput="window.saveLocal()"></textarea>
                        <canvas id="canvas_exp_regret" width="800" height="400" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full hidden dashed-bg-sm touch-none cursor-crosshair border-2 border-rose-300 rounded-xl bg-white/50" style="background-color: transparent;"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 만족한 경험 -->
                <div class="bg-blue-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-blue-200 flex flex-col h-[350px]">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3">
                        <label class="font-bold text-blue-900 flex items-center gap-2 text-lg"><i class="fa-regular fa-face-smile-beam text-2xl text-blue-500"></i> 선택에 만족한 경험</label>
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 w-32 items-end z-10">
                            <div class="flex bg-blue-200 p-1 rounded-lg w-full">
                                <button onclick="window.setMode('exp_satisfy', 'text')" id="btn_text_exp_satisfy" class="flex-1 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-white text-blue-600 shadow-sm rounded-md transition-all">⌨️ 자판</button>
                                <button onclick="window.setMode('exp_satisfy', 'draw')" id="btn_draw_exp_satisfy" class="flex-1 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-800 rounded-md transition-all">🖊️ 펜</button>
                            </div>
                            <div id="toolbar_exp_satisfy" class="hidden flex-col gap-1 w-full">
                                <div class="flex bg-amber-100 p-1 rounded-lg w-full border border-amber-200">
                                    <button onclick="window.pads['exp_satisfy'].setTool('pen')" id="btn_tool_pen_exp_satisfy" class="flex-1 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-white text-amber-700 shadow-sm rounded-md transition-all" title="쓰기">✏️</button>
                                    <button onclick="window.pads['exp_satisfy'].setTool('eraser')" id="btn_tool_eraser_exp_satisfy" class="flex-1 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-800 rounded-md transition-all" title="지우개">🧹</button>
                                </div>
                                <button onclick="window.pads['exp_satisfy'].clear()" class="w-full text-xs bg-rose-100 text-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-200 py-1 rounded-md font-bold shadow-sm">전체 지우기</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="relative flex-1 w-full h-full -mt-4">
                        <textarea id="exp_satisfy" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full clay-input p-4 text-lg font-medium resize-none dashed-bg-sm outline-none focus:bg-blue-100 transition-colors" placeholder="(예) 가방을 살 때 가격과 품질을 미리 비교해 보고 구입했습니다." oninput="window.saveLocal()"></textarea>
                        <canvas id="canvas_exp_satisfy" width="800" height="400" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full hidden dashed-bg-sm touch-none cursor-crosshair border-2 border-blue-300 rounded-xl bg-white/50" style="background-color: transparent;"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. 음식 월드컵 (합리적 선택 연습) -->
        <section class="mb-12">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-end mb-4 border-b-4 border-amber-200 pb-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl font-jua">2</div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-jua text-amber-900">내가 먹고 싶은 음식 월드컵! 자신의 선택 기준을 적어보세요.</h2>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border-4 border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm">
                <div class="text-center mb-6 text-gray-600 font-bold">👇 자신이 가장 먹고 싶은 음식을 하나 선택하세요.</div>
                
                <!-- 선택 그리드 -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-8">
                    <div class="food-card border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center cursor-pointer bg-gray-50" onclick="window.selectFood('치킨')">
                        <div class="text-4xl mb-2">🍗</div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-lg">치킨</div>
                        <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm">(15,000원)</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="food-card border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center cursor-pointer bg-gray-50" onclick="window.selectFood('샐러드')">
                        <div class="text-4xl mb-2">🥗</div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-lg">샐러드</div>
                        <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm">(9,500원)</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="food-card border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center cursor-pointer bg-gray-50" onclick="window.selectFood('삼겹살')">
                        <div class="text-4xl mb-2">🥓</div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-lg">삼겹살</div>
                        <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm">(16,000원)</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="food-card border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center cursor-pointer bg-gray-50" onclick="window.selectFood('마라탕')">
                        <div class="text-4xl mb-2">🍲</div>
                        <div class="font-bold text-lg">마라탕</div>
                        <div class="text-gray-500 text-sm">(16,000원)</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col border-[3px] border-amber-300 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="bg-amber-100 p-4 flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-amber-900 border-b-[3px] border-amber-300">
                        <span class="text-lg">내가 위 음식을 선택한 기준은?</span>
                        <div class="flex bg-white p-1 rounded-lg w-32 border border-amber-200">
                            <button onclick="window.setMode('reason', 'text')" id="btn_text_reason" class="flex-1 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-white text-blue-600 shadow-sm rounded-md transition-all">⌨️ 자판</button>
                            <button onclick="window.setMode('reason', 'draw')" id="btn_draw_reason" class="flex-1 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-800 rounded-md transition-all">🖊️ 펜</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div id="toolbar_reason" class="hidden flex bg-amber-50 p-2 gap-2 justify-end border-b border-amber-200">
                        <div class="flex bg-white p-1 rounded-lg border border-amber-200 w-32">
                            <button onclick="window.pads['reason'].setTool('pen')" id="btn_tool_pen_reason" class="flex-1 py-1 text-xs font-bold bg-white text-amber-700 shadow-sm rounded-md transition-all" title="펜">✏️</button>
                            <button onclick="window.pads['reason'].setTool('eraser')" id="btn_tool_eraser_reason" class="flex-1 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-800 rounded-md transition-all" title="지우개">🧹</button>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="window.pads['reason'].clear()" class="text-xs bg-rose-100 text-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-md font-bold shadow-sm">지우기</button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="p-0 bg-white relative min-h-[250px]">
                        <textarea id="reason" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full p-6 text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 resize-none overflow-y-auto outline-none focus:bg-amber-50 transition-colors dashed-bg" placeholder="(예) 고기와 야채를 함께 먹을 수 있어 마라탕을 선택했습니다." oninput="window.saveLocal()"></textarea>
                        <canvas id="canvas_reason" width="1000" height="400" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full hidden dashed-bg touch-none cursor-crosshair bg-white" style="background-color: transparent;"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. 배운 내용 정리 & 정답 확인 -->
        <section class="mb-12">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 border-b-4 border-amber-200 pb-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl font-jua">3</div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-jua text-amber-900">오늘 배운 내용을 정리해 봅시다.</h2>
                </div>
                <div id="quizScoreDisplay" class="font-jua text-2xl text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-4 py-1 rounded-full hidden">0 / 7점</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-200 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm">
                
                <div class="mb-10">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-800 text-lg mb-4 text-center bg-amber-100 py-2 rounded-lg">📝 빈칸에 알맞은 단어를 적으세요.</h3>
                    <div class="bg-stone-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 text-lg md:text-xl font-medium leading-loose text-center md:text-left">
                        사람들은 경제활동을 하면서 수많은 선택을 합니다. <br class="hidden md:block">
                        이때, <input type="text" id="q1" class="inline-blank" placeholder="ㄱㄱ" oninput="window.saveLocal()" autocomplete="off"><span id="mark1" class="ml-1 mr-2"></span>, 
                        <input type="text" id="q2" class="inline-blank" placeholder="ㅍㅈ" oninput="window.saveLocal()" autocomplete="off"><span id="mark2" class="ml-1 mr-2"></span>, 
                        <input type="text" id="q3" class="inline-blank" placeholder="ㄷㅈㅇ" oninput="window.saveLocal()" autocomplete="off"><span id="mark3" class="ml-1 mr-2"></span> 등 여러 가지를 고려하여 <br class="hidden md:block">
                        <input type="text" id="q4" class="inline-blank" placeholder="ㅎㄹㅈ" oninput="window.saveLocal()" autocomplete="off"><span id="mark4" class="ml-1"></span>으로 선택해야 합니다.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-800 text-lg mb-4 text-center bg-amber-100 py-2 rounded-lg">⭕❌ O/X 퀴즈를 풀어보세요.</h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-6 text-lg md:text-xl px-2 md:px-6 font-medium">
                        <li class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">
                            <div class="flex-1 leading-snug">1. 경제활동을 할 때 가격, 품질, 디자인 등을 고려하여 선택해야 한다.</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                (<input type="text" id="q5" class="inline-blank ox-blank text-center uppercase" placeholder="O/X" maxlength="1" oninput="window.saveLocal()" autocomplete="off">)<span id="mark5"></span>
                            </div>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">
                            <div class="flex-1 leading-snug">2. 합리적인 선택을 하면 돈이나 자원을 낭비하게 된다.</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                (<input type="text" id="q6" class="inline-blank ox-blank text-center uppercase" placeholder="O/X" maxlength="1" oninput="window.saveLocal()" autocomplete="off">)<span id="mark6"></span>
                            </div>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-2">
                            <div class="flex-1 leading-snug">3. 경제활동을 할 때 합리적인 선택을 하면 큰 만족을 얻을 수 있다.</div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                (<input type="text" id="q7" class="inline-blank ox-blank text-center uppercase" placeholder="O/X" maxlength="1" oninput="window.saveLocal()" autocomplete="off">)<span id="mark7"></span>
                            </div>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-8 text-center">
                    <button onclick="window.gradeQuiz()" class="bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white font-jua text-xl py-3 px-8 rounded-full shadow-md transition transform hover:scale-105">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-check mr-2"></i> 정답 확인하기
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 제출 버튼 -->
        <div class="text-center relative z-10 mt-12">
            <button onclick="window.submitAll()" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-600 text-white font-jua text-2xl py-4 px-16 rounded-full shadow-xl transform transition hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-2xl active:scale-95">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane mr-2"></i> 선생님께 학습지 제출하기
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 오류 알림창 -->
    <div id="customAlertModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-50 z-[100] hidden flex justify-center items-center p-4">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 max-w-sm w-full text-center shadow-2xl modal-animate">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-3">💬</div>
            <p id="customAlertMessage" class="text-gray-800 font-bold mb-6 break-keep"></p>
            <button onclick="document.getElementById('customAlertModal').classList.add('hidden')" class="w-full bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-xl transition">확인</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 삭제 확인 알림창 -->
    <div id="customConfirmModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-50 z-[110] hidden flex justify-center items-center p-4">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 max-w-sm w-full text-center shadow-2xl modal-animate">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-3 text-rose-500">⚠️</div>
            <p id="customConfirmMessage" class="text-gray-800 font-bold mb-6 break-keep"></p>
            <div class="flex gap-3">
                <button onclick="window.closeConfirmModal()" class="flex-1 bg-gray-200 hover:bg-gray-300 text-gray-800 font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-xl transition">취소</button>
                <button id="customConfirmOkBtn" class="flex-1 bg-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-600 text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded-xl transition">삭제</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 결과 안내 팝업 -->
    <div id="resultModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-50 z-[90] hidden flex justify-center items-center p-4">
